      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776097273802,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Services - Some code that owns some data (state) and all the process around that data.\n    - if you want to change an employees phone number, unless you own that service, don't touch their database.\n\n    - Service Oriented Architecture - your company is too big for one monolith.\n\nAPIs -\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Services - Some code that owns some data (state) and all the process around that data.\n    - if you want to change an employees phone number, unless you own that service, don't touch their database.\n\n    - Service Oriented Architecture - your company is too big for one monolith.\n\nAPIs -\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
